task.vi:
Có điều gì sai với câu lệnh lặp while sau đây?
while ( z >= 0 )
   sum += z;

task.en:
What's wrong with the following while repetition statement?
while ( z >= 0 )
   sum += z;

example.code:
#include <iostream>

int main() {
    int count{0};
    if (std::cin >> count) {
        if (count > 10) {
            std::cout << "Count is greater than 10.\n";
        } else {
            std::cout << "Count is less than or equal to 10.\n";
        }
    }
    return 0;
}

question.vi:
Đoạn mã sau sẽ in ra gì khi `gender` có giá trị bằng 1?
if (gender == 1)
    std::cout << "Woman\n";
else;
    std::cout << "Man\n";

question.en:
What does the following snippet print when `gender` is 1?
if (gender == 1)
    std::cout << "Woman\n";
else;
    std::cout << "Man\n";

example.code:
#include <iostream>

int main() {
    unsigned int sum{0};
    unsigned int x{1};

    while (x <= 10) {
        sum += x;
        ++x;
    }

    std::cout << "The sum is: " << sum << std::endl;
    return 0;
}

